B.Ss=new A.kb("What we keep","Your email address, so you can sign in. The name and colour you pick for your profile. Everything you make in the game \u2014 your collection, your garden, your quests and anything you write \u2014 so it can follow you between devices.")
B.Sr=new A.kb("What never leaves your phone","The camera in Rainmaker only measures movement, frame by frame, on the device. Nothing is recorded, saved or uploaded. Guest mode keeps everything on this phone until you make an account.")
B.Sy=new A.kb("Who else sees it","Nobody else in the game. We do not sell your data and there is no advertising. Supabase hosts the database and handles sign-in on our behalf.")
B.Sv=new A.kb("Your choices","Change your email or password from Settings. Delete your account from Settings too. For a copy of your data or any other request, write to privacy@liferoad.app.")
